<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Vera Health Notes handles website visits, printable resources, and third-party requests.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="copy">
    <p>Vera Health Notes is a public website. There are currently no visitor accounts, newsletter signup forms, or forms for submitting health information. The printable blood pressure log is a blank sheet. Entries you write on a printed copy stay with you.</p>
    <h2>Technical information</h2>
    <p>Cloudflare delivers and protects the site. Delivering and securing web pages can involve processing information such as IP addresses, browser details, and requested pages. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a> for its practices. We request typefaces from Google Fonts. See <a href="https://developers.google.com/fonts/faq/privacy">Google Fonts’ privacy information</a> for those requests.</p>
    <h2>External sites</h2>
    <p>When you follow a link to another website, its privacy practices apply. See our <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a> for more about this site’s browser requests. Our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> shows the current status of our public contact channel.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
